# Files Vercel does not need in the upload bundle.
#
# Keeping this list tight matters: `vercel` uploads the whole directory before
# building, so anything left in slows every deploy and inflates the function
# bundle.

node_modules
dist
.git
.env
.env.local
.vercel

# Local tooling output
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store

# NOTE: project-nova/ (the Python/FastAPI service) is deliberately NOT excluded.
#
# .vercelignore is repo-wide: it applies to every Vercel project built from this
# repository, not just this one. The `project-nova` Vercel project has its Root
# Directory set to `project-nova`, so excluding that folder here left it with no
# source to build and every deploy failed with "No FastAPI entrypoint found".
#
# Leaving it in costs a few KB per upload. Excluding it would break that
# project permanently, so it stays.
